msgid "区域内存在时间"
msgstr "Existence time in the area"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/video/time_in_zone.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/video/time_in_zone.rst:9
msgid "计算检测对象在指定区域内的停留时长。"
