msgstr "The coordinates of the target area, a list of polygon points."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/video/time_in_zone.rst:41
msgid "点击绘制区域进入绘制页面"
msgstr "Click the drawing area to enter the drawing page"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/video/time_in_zone.rst:42
msgid "判定点"
msgstr "decision point"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/video/time_in_zone.rst:43
msgid "目标需在区域内的判断点，常用 ``CENTER``。"
msgstr ""
"The target needs to be at the judgment point within the area. ``CENTER`` is "
"commonly used."

